Knowing the true pose and position of the second AR marker, the pose and position calculated by the system can be evaluated.

During the experiment, the paper with 2 AR markers were place in front of the camera, AR markers were printed with dimension 85mm by 85mm, the camera was recording with resolution 640 by 480 pixel. A video clip was recorded while the paper with markers was constantly moving in front of the camera. Using the video, the algorithm is able to find pose position information of AR marker with ID 66 in respect to the AR marker with ID 88 which used as real-world coordinate system.
